1075
01:11:55.319 --> 01:11:56.355
Box on.

1076
01:11:56.439 --> 01:11:57.510
You're gonna throw that right.

1077
01:11:57.600 --> 01:12:01.070
You better put your chin right down,
otherwise you're going to lose your apple.

1078
01:12:01.279 --> 01:12:03.112
Go on, Lenny. Get it down.

1079
01:12:03.359 --> 01:12:05.192
