1084
01:12:22.159 --> 01:12:23.275
Oh, feel that.

1085
01:12:31.399 --> 01:12:32.993
Slip it, slip it.

1086
01:12:33.159 --> 01:12:36.869
Slip it, slip it, that's it.

1087
01:12:36.960 --> 01:12:38.154
That's it, don't lean in, don't lean in,

1088
