My Lenny don't drink no more.

1170
01:19:13.239 --> 01:19:17.837
But the day that you fucking die,
I am going to go and buy him a shandy.

1171
01:19:21.119 --> 01:19:23.395
Couldn't do much for his brother,
though, could he, eh?

1172
01:19:29.800 --> 01:19:31.917
You're nothing to me, Jim.

1173
01:19:32.880 --> 01:19:34.314
You hear me?

1174
01:19:34.560 --> 01:19:36.358
You are nothing to me.

1175
01:19:37.920 --> 01:19:39.114
Look at me.

1176
