1211
01:23:15.600 --> 01:23:16.875
(CROWD CHEERING)

1212
01:23:38.840 --> 01:23:39.876
Come on, Len.

1213
01:23:50.960 --> 01:23:52.552
JIM: <i>I've made him into a man.</i>

1214
01:23:52.760 --> 01:23:55.115
<i>I'm doing it for his own benefit.</i>

1215
01:24:34.560 --> 01:24:37.279
