1216
01:24:40.840 --> 01:24:42.592
Who's the Guv'nor?

1217
01:24:43.399 --> 01:24:45.073
Who's the Guv'nor?

1218
01:24:45.600 --> 01:24:47.113
I'm the Guv'nor.

1219
01:24:47.800 --> 01:24:49.756
I'm the Guv'nor.

1220
01:24:52.680 --> 01:24:54.000
Who's the Guv'nor?

1221
01:24:59.359 --> 01:25:03.239
I'm the Guv'nor, I'm the Guv'nor.

1222
01:25:04.319 --> 01:25:06.231
I'm the Guv'nor.

1223
01:25:11.880 --> 01:25:13.951
LENNY: <i>I'm the Guv'nor.</i>

1224
01:25:20.399 --> 01:25:24.314
You've got to fight to get anywhere,
you know, if you don't fight you're just

1225
01:25:24.439 --> 01:25:26.716
one of the crowd, and one of the crowd
don't get nothing.

1226
01:25:27.880 --> 01:25:30.235
So I started off as a kid, fighting.

1227
01:25:30.840 --> 01:25:34.310
And I was the best when I was a kid.

1228
01:25:35.000 --> 01:25:36.514
And I wanna be the best, now.

1229
01:25:38.520 --> 01:25:41.557
You know, you've got
to survive in the East End.

1230
01:25:42.520 --> 01:25:43.555
And, er...

1231
01:25:43.640 --> 01:25:45.359
INTERVIEWER:
So how did you manage to survive?

1232
01:25:45.439 --> 01:25:48.432
Be the best fighter, be the Guv'nor.
